  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Rose gold-tone 316L stainless steel case with a rose gold-tone stainless steel bracelet. Fixed tachymeter scale black bezel. Black dial with rose gold-tone hands and index hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Luminescent hands and markers. Chronograph - three sub-dials displaying:  60 second, 30 minute and 1/10th of a second. Quartz movement. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 40 mm, case thickness: 12.16 mm. Band width: 20 mm. Fold over clasp with a safety release. Water resistant at 100 meters / 330 feet. Functions: chronograph, hour, minute, second. Pr516 Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Swiss Made. Tissot PR516 Chronograph Quartz Black Dial Men's Watch T1494173305100.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Pr516</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T1494173305100</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\"